sequenceDiagram
    participant HR as 企业HR
    participant Controller as InterviewController
    participant Service as InterviewService
    participant InterviewDao as InterviewDao
    participant ResumeDao as ResumeManageDao
    participant MsgService as MessageService
    participant SMS as 短信接口
    participant Email as 邮件接口
    participant DTO as InterviewDTO

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. 发送面试邀约
    %% ==========================================
    Note over HR, DTO: 发送面试邀约
    HR->>Controller: 选择求职者, 点击"发送面试邀约"
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 获取求职者联系方式
    activate Service

    Service->>ResumeDao: 校验企业权限<br/>(确认简历投递给本企业)
    activate ResumeDao
    ResumeDao-->>Service: 验证通过
    deactivate ResumeDao

    Service->>ResumeDao: 查询求职者联系方式<br/>(手机号/邮箱)
    activate ResumeDao
    ResumeDao-->>Service: 返回联系方式
    deactivate ResumeDao

    Service-->>Controller: 返回联系方式及简历信息
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>HR: 展示面试邀约表单<br/>(预填求职者姓名/联系方式)

    HR->>Controller: 填写邀约信息<br/>(面试时间/地点/形式/联系人/备注)
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 发送面试邀请
    activate Service

    Service->>Service: 数据校验<br/>(面试时间不能早于当前时间)
    Service->>InterviewDao: 创建面试邀约记录<br/>(状态:待确认)
    activate InterviewDao
    InterviewDao-->>Service: 返回邀约ID
    deactivate InterviewDao

    Service->>ResumeDao: 更新投递记录状态为'INTERVIEW'
    activate ResumeDao
    ResumeDao-->>Service: 更新成功
    deactivate ResumeDao

    deactivate Service
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. 多渠道通知求职者
    %% ==========================================
    Note over HR, DTO: 多渠道通知求职者
    Service->>MsgService: 创建站内信<br/>(面试邀约通知)
    activate MsgService
    MsgService-->>Service: 站内信已创建
    deactivate MsgService

    alt 求职者绑定手机号
        Service->>SMS: 发送面试邀约短信
        activate SMS
        Note right of SMS: 短信内容示例:<br/>【校企慧】XX公司邀请您参加面试<br/>时间: 2026-04-15 14:00<br/>地点: 成都市郫都区XX大厦3楼<br/>请登录平台查看详情并确认。
        SMS-->>Service: 发送成功
        deactivate SMS
    end

    Service-->>Controller: 邀约发送成功
    Controller-->>HR: 提示"面试邀约已发送"
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 3. 查看邀约列表
    %% ==========================================
    Note over HR, DTO: 查看邀约列表
    HR->>Controller: 进入"面试管理"页面
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 获取面试邀约列表
    activate Service
    Service->>InterviewDao: 查询本企业的面试邀约记录
    activate InterviewDao
    Note right of InterviewDao: 状态筛选:<br/>- PENDING: 待求职者确认<br/>- ACCEPTED: 求职者已接受<br/>- REJECTED: 求职者已拒绝<br/>- COMPLETED: 面试已完成<br/>- CANCELLED: 企业已取消
    InterviewDao-->>Service: 返回邀约列表
    deactivate InterviewDao

    Service->>InterviewDao: 关联查询职位/简历信息
    activate InterviewDao
    InterviewDao-->>Service: 返回补充数据
    deactivate InterviewDao

    Service-->>Controller: 返回邀约列表
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>HR: 展示邀约列表<br/>(求职者/职位/面试时间/状态)
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 4. 取消面试邀约
    %% ==========================================
    Note over HR, DTO: 取消面试邀约
    HR->>Controller: 点击"取消邀约"
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 取消面试邀约
    activate Service

    Service->>InterviewDao: 校验企业权限<br/>(邀约属于本企业且状态为PENDING)
    activate InterviewDao
    InterviewDao-->>Service: 验证通过
    deactivate InterviewDao

    Service->>InterviewDao: 更新邀约状态为'CANCELLED'<br/>保存取消原因
    activate InterviewDao
    InterviewDao-->>Service: 更新成功
    deactivate InterviewDao

    Service->>ResumeDao: 更新投递记录状态回'VIEWED'
    activate ResumeDao
    ResumeDao-->>Service: 更新成功
    deactivate ResumeDao

    Service->>MsgService: 通知求职者邀约已取消
    activate MsgService
    MsgService-->>Service: 通知已发送
    deactivate MsgService

    Service-->>Controller: 取消成功
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>HR: 提示"面试邀约已取消"
    deactivate Controller

    %% ==========================================
    %% 5. 处理求职者确认反馈
    %% ==========================================
    Note over HR, DTO: 处理求职者确认反馈
    Note over Service: 求职者端确认/拒绝后, 企业端同步状态
    Service->>InterviewDao: 求职者确认接受<br/>更新邀约状态为'ACCEPTED'
    activate InterviewDao
    InterviewDao-->>Service: 状态更新
    deactivate InterviewDao

    Service->>MsgService: 异步通知企业HR
    activate MsgService
    MsgService->>MsgService: 发送站内信<br/>"求职者已接受面试邀约"
    MsgService-->>Service: 通知已发送
    deactivate MsgService